        "path": "python_programs/pascal.py",
        "new_content": "\ndef pascal(n):\n    rows = []\n    for r in range(n):\n        row = []\n        for c in range(0, r + 1):\n            if r == 0:\n                value = 1\n            else:\n                upleft = rows[r - 1][c - 1] if c > 0 else 0\n                upright = rows[r - 1][c] if c < r else 0\n                value = upleft + upright\n            row.append(value)\n        rows.append(row)\n\n    return rows\n\n\n\"\"\"\nPascal's Triangle\npascal\n\n\n\nInput:\n    n: The number of rows to return\n\nPrecondition:\n    n >= 1\n\nOutput:\n    The first n rows of Pascal's triangle as a list of n lists\n\nExample:\n    >>> pascal(5)\n    [[1], [1, 1], [1, 2, 1], [1, 3, 3, 1], [1, 4, 6, 4, 1]]\n\"\"\"\n"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "首行 r=0,c=0 时两个边界分支都取 0，导致首行为 [0] 而非 [1]，后续行整体递推错误。特判 r==0 使首行元素为 1，其余行保持原有的上行相邻求和逻辑；仅修改允许文件 python_programs/pascal.py。",
